833
00:35:35,910 --> 00:35:36,410
Don't worry.

834
00:35:36,690 --> 00:35:38,790
If you get crickets, you can always start things off yourself.

835
00:35:38,850 --> 00:35:39,110
Yeah.

836
00:35:39,530 --> 00:35:40,670
Ask a question that you often hear.

837
00:35:40,910 --> 00:35:44,660
Like, one question I often get is, that can usually break the ice.

838
00:35:45,020 --> 00:35:46,120
Okay, that's a good tip.

839
00:35:46,140 --> 00:35:48,220
I feel a little more confident about presentations now.

840
00:35:48,290 --> 00:35:49,010
Awesome.

841
00:35:49,030 --> 00:35:50,030
Practice makes perfect, right?

