00:41:09,300 --> 00:41:30,750
expressing appreciation yeah expressing appreciation it seems like such a small thing but it can make a huge difference totally like in a busy work environment it's easy to forget to just acknowledge the people around you right and show that you value their contributions exactly so how do we go beyond just a quick thank you and make it more meaningful yeah what are some tips for that

